# Local development reads this file. A deployed build gets every value from the
# Infisical `dev` or `prod` environment instead (see INFISICAL.md).
#
# The browser calls its own origin: Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:4006
# (vite.config.ts) and nginx does the same in production. Leave VITE_API_URL
# unset — in particular, do not set it in the frontend project's Infisical
# `prod` environment, or the web build goes back to cross-origin calls.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4002

# The API origin shown to users and called by outside clients (MCP connectors,
# mobile). A deployed build needs this; it comes from the frontend project's
# Infisical `prod` environment at build time, or a Coolify build arg. Local dev
# falls back to http://localhost:4006.
# VITE_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.dirah.co.za
